+
+      <div class="section" id="research-type-collaboration">
+        <div class="section-title">
+          <h2>Research Type Distribution & Collaboration Indicators</h2>
+          <p>Publication types and authorship as a collaboration proxy.</p>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="grid">
+          <div class="card" style="grid-column: span 6">
+            <h3>Research type (top categories, multi-label)</h3>
+            <div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chart-research-types"></canvas></div>
+            <p class="note">
+              Records may list multiple publication types; counts reflect exploded type labels (so totals exceed the
+              number of rows).
+            </p>
