+          <div class="card" style="grid-column: span 6">
+            <h3>Median authors by year</h3>
+            <div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chart-authors-year"></canvas></div>
+            <p class="note">
+              Median authors is stable here; deeper collaboration analysis may use full distributions and topic/country
+              stratification.
+            </p>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="section" id="methods">
+        <div class="section-title">
+          <h2>Methods & Data Integrity</h2>
+          <p>Reproducibility notes and limitations (no fabricated numbers).</p>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="grid">
+          <div class="card" style="grid-column: span 12">
+            <h3>Computation rules used in this report</h3>
+            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted)">
+              <li>
+                All figures and tables are computed from <span class="mono">benchmark/data.csv</span> in this
+                workspace.
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                Monthly charts use records with known months only (<span class="mono">pub_month_num != 0</span>).
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                Open access rate is the mean of the boolean column <span class="mono">open_access</span> within each
+                group.
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                Research type counts are computed by splitting <span class="mono">research_type</span> on semicolons
+                and trimming whitespace.
+              </li>
+              <li>
+                Emerging-topic MoM growth is computed per topic as (current - previous)/previous, using only months
+                where the previous month had &gt;0 publications; summarized over the last 6 observed months.
+              </li>
+            </ul>
+            <p class="note danger" style="margin-top: 12px">
+              <strong>Limitations:</strong> Major topics are missing for a large fraction of records (MeSH indexing
